# Enhanced Image Upload Specification

## Visual Flow Overview

### Upload Page Layout
The upload page is organized into two main sections:
1. Upload Action Area
   - Large drop zone for file selection
   - Clear format/size limits display
   - Upload initiation controls
   - Current upload status

2. History Panel
   - Vertically stacked upload records
   - Most recent uploads at top
   - Collapsible record sections
   - Status icons and progress bars

### Timeline Visualization
Each upload record shows its progression through time:
1. Initial State
   - File selection confirmation
   - Size and format validation
   - [WAIT] status indicator

2. Processing Flow
   - Real-time progress updates
   - [>] processing indicator
   - Current operation details
   - Time elapsed display

3. Completion State
   - [OK] success indicator
   - [TEMP] unpublished state
   - [PUB] published state
   - Timestamp for each stage

## Record Management

### Collapsible Records
Each upload record provides:
1. Collapsed View
   - File name and timestamp
   - Current status icon
   - Progress indicator
   - Quick actions (expand/collapse, cancel)

2. Expanded View
   - Detailed file information (name, size, dimensions)
   - Processing timeline
   - Generated previews (160px, 400px variants)
   - Action buttons (excluding retry)
   - Error details (if any)

### Status Tracking
Visual indicators for each stage:
1. Pre-processing
   - File validation status
   - Size check results
   - Format verification

2. Active Processing
   - Format conversion progress
   - Variant generation (160px, 400px, 2048px)
   - Analysis progress
   - Storage status

3. Post-processing
   - Publication readiness
   - Attribute review
   - Visibility toggle
   - Share options

## User Interaction Flow

### Upload Initiation
1. File Selection
   - Drop zone highlight on hover
