## Database Schema

### Image Node
Properties:
- id: Unique identifier
- title: Generated or user-provided title
- description: Generated or user-provided description
- fullUrl: Full size image (max 2048px)
- previewUrl: Medium size preview (400px)
- graphUrl: Graph view thumbnail (160px)
- pHash: Perceptual hash for duplicate detection
- width: Original image width
- height: Original image height
- createdAt: Upload timestamp
- userId: Reference to uploader

### Attribute Node
Properties:
- category: Classification of the attribute
- value: The attribute value
- context: Additional context about the attribute
- prominence: Importance or visibility in the image
- reasoning: Explanation for the attribute assignment

### Relationships
- (User)-[:UPLOADED]->(Image)
- (Image)-[:HAS_ATTRIBUTE]->(Attribute)

### User Details
When retrieving an image, user details include:
- id: User identifier
- name: Display name
- email: User email address